[Music]  if monster hunter world is your first  monster hunter you may be wondering how  to capture a monster fortunately despite  all the dense tutorials and steep  learning curve it's not as tough as it  may seem  first you'll need a shock trap and a few  tranq bombs you can craft the shock trap  with a thunder bug and a trap tool you  can only carry one with you at a time so  don't worry about crafting a bunch of  these and to craft tranq bombs you'll  need a sleep herb and a parish room the  good news is that if you're doing a  capture quest both these items will be  available for you in the box at the  start of the quest once you've stocked  up on equipment you will need to track  the monster like any other hunt it's  important to note that you don't need to  do a capture quest in order to catch a  monster but you will need to craft your  own equipment fight the monster until it  starts limping and then set a shock trap  you can only carry one trap at a time so  make sure to place it carefully if the  monster runs off to take a nap you can  set it next to it and it should trigger  automatically after its stun throw down  a couple tranq bombs and you're done the  benefit of capturing a monster is  opposed to killing it is that you get  more monster parts at the end of the  quest you won't be able to skin it but  if you're having trouble finding a  certain part this should improve your  odds  if you're playing monster hunter world  and you have any questions feel free to  hit me up on Twitter or leave a comment  below and I'll try to help out thank you  for watching

